  <item>
    <title>Vol58.再见！2025！浪子新年小总结！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6943ab0bc4f10bdeea08bf3e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6943ab0bc4f10bdeea08bf3e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小八：一年又过去了，无愧自己就很棒了！（微博@小八小八就会哈哈）</span></p><span></span><p><span>良辰：再见，边城浪子，再见，武汉，再见，2025！（小红书：良辰有点沉）</span></p><span></span><p><span>丁懒：Shit happens, just stop giving a shit.（微博@布丁不懒）</span></p><span></span><p><span>张帅：新的一年，要健康、平安、幸福！（小红书：别管我叫张帅）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> 夸夸自己！编剧，双相，20万，希望都在今年完结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 不起床，又活了一年！牛啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 工作内耗少一点！爱情幸福感多一点！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a> 掌声！今年最大的成就是救了一个人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2582">43:02</a> 拉子合家欢乐，爸爸面对现实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2823">47:03</a> 妹妹不要再做望着别人蛋糕的小孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a> 放下助人情节，但是这个姐夫真的不行！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3726">62:06</a> Lib！旅途顺利！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3795">63:15</a> 忆往昔，这一年我们做了这些快乐的事······</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>剪辑：良辰</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>设计：建国（小红书：刘建国-建建）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>音乐采样：《生日祝福歌》 格格</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《回留》方大同</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢武汉K11艺术购物中心的星光剧场，对本节目提供场地支持！！！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67272dddd8bd5ac71857448c/lp7H-ZhHAJfbiUrEnpsv9eDjRixw.m4a" length="118740431" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:02:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fueh2TKShSzUAIHPTmzMvgCjXGuk.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.57好焦虑啊！我的健康！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6936b3893fec3166cfe9a688</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6936b3893fec3166cfe9a688</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Dec 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>良辰：今天开心今天活，明天就焦虑就再说。（小红书：良辰有点沉）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小八：健康焦虑是一时，所以二十三时都要快乐哇。（微博@小八小八就会哈哈）</span></p><span></span><p><span>丁懒：愿爱无忧 愿头无痛。（微博@布丁不懒）</span></p><span></span><p><span>张帅：张飞的身体里为什么住着林黛玉！（小红书：别管我叫张帅）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 我将迅速远离这个房间的一切病源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 我的身体壮如牛犊，但我觉得自己有病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 本宫的头好痛，传薛怀义上来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a> 没病是因为没查，小血管瘤不许偷偷变大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a> 甲亢！怎么像双相？好像和我的刻板印象不一样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> 健康焦虑有一点，留学焦虑大大的有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a> 我的身体和我打商量，我说哪疼就哪疼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 离开妈妈的伞发现外面没雨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a> 缓解焦虑怎么办？不行还是看看 吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2528">42:08</a> 奶奶！别测了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">46:45</a> 腿断了？不可能！我摸了，没断！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3046">50:46</a> 坚强老太挺直腰杆，但腰杆骨折</span></p><span></span><p><span>参与线下录制/加入听友群，添加小浪V信号：whbclz</span></p><span></span><p><span>诚邀各位关注小程序「黑镜计划」，第一时间获取线下录制相关资讯，不定期掉落各种交友活动，期待大家线上、线下一起浪起来～</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢武汉K11艺术购物中心的星光剧场，对本节目提供场地支持！！！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67272dddd8bd5ac71857448c/lsKrlSHv3x-3nvkkFTfkZ2IrDNzD.m4a" length="59576634" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fueh2TKShSzUAIHPTmzMvgCjXGuk.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol56.身材焦虑：焦虑吃 焦虑穿 焦虑别人怎么看</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692da6100d5237d4de6b575c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">692da6100d5237d4de6b575c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Dec 2025 14:42:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>良辰：都是我辛辛苦苦一口一口吃的，我凭什么减肥！（小红书：良辰有点沉）</span></p><span></span><p><span>张帅：和身材和解不了，我只能和焦虑和解。（小红书：别管我叫张帅）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 从游泳队退下来，我屁股炸了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 欣赏美女的时候我最焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a> 哥们儿你不胖，因为我也不胖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 胖不重要，因为我特别会吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 想吃狗罐头，这对吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 同事：装货！但是这样吃确实健康。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> npd家庭就是连吃什么都要控制，从身材到形象的焦虑捆绑着我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 减肥成功了！但是一个月就胖回去了······</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 打破焦虑的办法就是忘记焦虑</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>剪辑：良辰</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>设计：建国（小红书：刘建国-建建）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>音乐采样：《自己》刘亦菲</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>参与线下录制/加入听友群，添加小浪V信号：whbclz</span></p><span></span><p><span>诚邀各位关注小程序「黑镜计划」，第一时间获取线下录制相关资讯，不定期掉落各种交友活动，期待大家线上、线下一起浪起来～</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢武汉K11艺术购物中心的星光剧场，对本节目提供场地支持！！！</span></p>]]></description>
