  <item>
    <title>Vol55.新闻女王——这太娘们儿了！！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69240e916018cc2c98547480</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69240e916018cc2c98547480</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Nov 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkFP9ZQnAJIjUQ-mLo3KBqf6ZXHh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>丁懒：长大了看懂了徐迎美，但还是觉得小八最美。（微博@布丁不懒）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小八：都给我当man姐。（微博@小八小八就会哈哈）</span></p><span></span><p><span>张帅：两手一伸就放电，顶天立地大女人。（小红书：别管我叫张帅）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 当一个女人有了野心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a> 两位影后</span><strong><span>世纪之吻</span></strong><span>！为女性友谊欢呼！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 一个事业有成的女人呼吁······</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a> 我在办公室吵了一个</span><strong><span>纯娘们儿</span></strong><span>架，谁的rt发激光？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="917">15:17</a> 我正式宣布——加入</span><strong><span>摩梭族</span></strong><span>这个权威的群体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1137">18:57</a> 环球小姐纯娘们儿，</span><strong><span>开团秒跟</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> 不起床上桌！</span><strong><span>看不到我</span></strong><span>是你的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 侵害一个女性的后果，和一个女性</span><strong><span>披露侵害</span></strong><span>的后果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1784">29:44</a> 我真是适应不了这个没有</span><strong><span>放电器官</span></strong><span>的世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 两代女性在此刻同辉（我爱这一刻）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2895">48:15</a> 我心目中的女性——是母猴子？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>剪辑：良辰</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>设计：建国（小红书：刘建国-建建）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>音乐采样：《烟花》窦靖童</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>参与线下录制/加入听友群，添加小浪V信号：whbclz</span></p><span></span><p><span>诚邀各位关注小程序「</span><strong><span>黑镜计划</span></strong><span>」，第一时间获取线下录制相关资讯，不定期掉落各种交友活动，期待大家线上、线下一起浪起来～</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢武汉K11艺术购物中心的星光剧场，对本节目提供场地支持！！！</span></p>]]></description>
