  <item>
    <title>Vol54.花钱复盘会：我钱呢？钱呢？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691adee46018cc2c983b2b4c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691adee46018cc2c983b2b4c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Nov 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkFP9ZQnAJIjUQ-mLo3KBqf6ZXHh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>良辰：挣得少花的多，两眼一睁就是开喝（小红书：良辰有点沉）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小八：钱虽然没了，焦虑更多了吖（微博@小八小八就会哈哈）</span></p><span></span><p><span>丁懒：Money comes and money goes.</span></p><span></span><p><span>It chose to be what I love most.（微博@布丁不懒）</span></p><span></span><p><span>张帅：兜里有点儿钱不是吃了就是喝了（小红书：别管我叫张帅）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> burr？我钱呢？怎么今年比去年花得更多了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 外婆别太爱我，小八《出医院记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 什么跃层让我的思想跃层？什么吸引力法则想要就能有？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 长发男的头发护理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 那个不能说的名字花钱请了一个······</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 孝出强大，我给我爸补缴社保</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> 吵架扔什么最省钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> 精打细算的王出现了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 拍三遍脑CT，我真是脑子有问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 不用再美了，我将不会再在美容上花钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2365">39:25</a> 想跪下来求求自己别吃了，结果发现跪下来更好吃了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 靠喝咖啡搞垮公司</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>剪辑：良辰</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>设计：刘建国</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>音乐采样：《金钱天使，金钱恶魔》法老/雷迪</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>诚邀各位关注小程序「</span><strong><span>黑镜计划</span></strong><span>」，第一时间获取线下录制相关资讯，不定期掉落各种交友活动，期待大家线上、线下一起浪起来～</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢</span><strong><span>武汉K11艺术购物中心的星光剧场</span></strong><span>，对本节目提供场地支持！！！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67272dddd8bd5ac71857448c/ltBWjOZeOTkqrIslCpXSQYz5z2RM.m4a" length="112845924" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fueh2TKShSzUAIHPTmzMvgCjXGuk.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
