  <item>
    <title>Vol53.【婚礼】感谢你特别邀请，来给你随礼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69119d4fd99642be96565953</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69119d4fd99642be96565953</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Nov 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkFP9ZQnAJIjUQ-mLo3KBqf6ZXHh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小八：婚礼到底办给谁，想清楚再办。（微博@小八小八就会哈哈）</span></p><span></span><p><span>良辰：不想结婚，但现在有点儿想办个婚礼。（小红书：良辰有点沉）</span></p><span></span><p><span>丁懒：婚礼不包含于婚姻，婚姻不包含于人生。人生方程，解集无限。（微博@布丁不懒）</span></p><span></span><p><span>张帅：我的婚礼所有人必须要听我的。（小红书：别管我叫张帅）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 闺蜜结婚我主持、摄影，寥寥草草坦坦荡荡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 哥们儿结婚反给我钱，还有这种好事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 我竟能以新娘的身份参加这样奢侈的婚礼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 和前夫的婚礼，只是给自己一个交代</span></p><span></span><p><span>不许喝酒，喝奶茶！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> 结婚只是为了</span><strong><span>给青春一个交代</span></strong><span>？你再考虑考虑呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1574">26:14</a> </span><strong><span>前男友的婚礼</span></strong><span>我一手操办！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> 扣扣索索结了婚，我手举起来了都不知道扇谁！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 梦想中的婚礼？小八攒演出现场······</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>剪辑：良辰</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>设计：建国（刘建国-建建）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>音乐采样：《没有人能够比我们更接近对方》声音玩具</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>诚邀各位关注小程序「</span><strong><span>黑镜计划</span></strong><span>」，第一时间获取线下录制相关资讯，不定期掉落各种交友活动，期待大家线上、线下一起浪起来～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkPhW8eJQ0O_Lk2kDY9JwLJXO2a2.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>感谢武汉K11艺术购物中心的星光剧场，对本节目提供场地支持！！！</span></p>]]></description>
